Annotation_Yolo11n

This repository packages the semantic point annotation and spatial heatmap method
implemented during the RoboDojo deposit_coin experiments. It uses Ultralytics
YOLO11n (AGPL-3.0); see LICENSE and https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics.
The offline HTML annotator is adapted from the project's original point-label UI.
No RoboDojo dataset images, trained weights, SSH credentials, or external task
repositories are included. Users obtain model weights and datasets separately.
